  "decision": "The D1 regime map helps diagnostically, but the naive previous-D1 overlay is not yet a deployable improvement. R1 remains strongest in uptrend but loses too much full-window profit if filtered by the coarse D1 label alone; R2's recent defense is real and is concentrated in transition/downtrend; R3 is strong historically but not active enough recently; R4 prior-day reclaim still does not earn its keep even inside chop. Next improvement should be a router audit using the EA's native intraday regime snapshot at each entry, then repair R4/chop rather than tightening R1 with this coarse daily classifier.",
